 ". The last steward left with the last of it, and the King has not noticed because nobody has dared tell him. The watch is owed. The guard is owed. The granary runs on the millers’ patience.”": "。上一任总管带着最后一点钱走了，国王还没发现，因为没人敢告诉他。城卫队的饷欠着。卫队的饷也欠着。粮仓全靠磨坊主们的耐心撑着。”",
 ". The last steward left with the last of it, and there is no King to notice - I have been ruling in the realm’s name, and nobody tells a regent anything. The watch is owed. The guard is owed. The granary runs on the millers’ patience.”": "。上一任总管带着最后一点钱走了，也没有国王会发现 - 一直是我以王国之名执政，而没人会告诉摄政者任何事。城卫队的饷欠着。卫队的饷也欠着。粮仓全靠磨坊主们的耐心撑着。”",
 "“It is empty. Not low - <0>empty</0>. The last steward left with the last of it, and the King has not noticed because nobody has dared tell him. The watch is owed. The guard is owed. The granary runs on the millers’ patience.”": "“它是空的。不是快空了 - 是<0>空的</0>。上一任总管带着最后一点钱走了，国王还没发现，因为没人敢告诉他。城卫队的饷欠着。卫队的饷也欠着。粮仓全靠磨坊主们的耐心撑着。”",
 "“It is empty. Not low - <0>empty</0>. The last steward left with the last of it, and there is no King to notice - I have been ruling in the realm’s name, and nobody tells a regent anything. The watch is owed. The guard is owed. The granary runs on the millers’ patience.”": "“它是空的。不是快空了 - 是<0>空的</0>。上一任总管带着最后一点钱走了，也没有国王会发现 - 一直是我以王国之名执政，而没人会告诉摄政者任何事。城卫队的饷欠着。卫队的饷也欠着。粮仓全靠磨坊主们的耐心撑着。”",
 "the King first of all - then the guard, the watch, the roads, the granary, the court, the sweepers, the schools, the markets, and grain for {0} mouths": "首先是国王 - 然后是卫队、城卫队、道路、粮仓、宫廷、清道夫、学校、市场，还有 {0} 张嘴的口粮",
 "the regency first of all - then the guard, the watch, the roads, the granary, the court, the sweepers, the schools, the markets, and grain for {0} mouths": "首先是摄政 - 然后是卫队、城卫队、道路、粮仓、宫廷、清道夫、学校、市场，还有 {0} 张嘴的口粮",
 "What the city costs<0>the King first of all - then the guard, the watch, the roads, the granary, the court, the sweepers, the schools, the markets, and grain for {0} mouths</0>": "王城的开销<0>首先是国王 - 然后是卫队、城卫队、道路、粮仓、宫廷、清道夫、学校、市场，还有 {0} 张嘴的口粮</0>",
 "What the city costs<0>the regency first of all - then the guard, the watch, the roads, the granary, the court, the sweepers, the schools, the markets, and grain for {0} mouths</0>": "王城的开销<0>首先是摄政 - 然后是卫队、城卫队、道路、粮仓、宫廷、清道夫、学校、市场，还有 {0} 张嘴的口粮</0>",
 "🔭 The dashed lines are the Hand’s guess, if nothing changes: about <0>{0} ◉</0> a close, so roughly <1>{1}</1> in the strongroom at the last close{2} Works that finish, families that come or go, the winds and the King will all move it; the shaded band is how far off he expects to be.": "🔭 虚线是首相的估计，假设一切照旧：每次结算约 <0>{0} ◉</0>，因此最后一次结算时金库里大约会有 <1>{1}</1>{2}工程完工、人家迁入迁出、风向变化和国王，都会让这一预测有所变动；阴影带是他预计的误差范围。",
 "in the strongroom at the last close{0} Works that finish, families that come or go, the winds and the King will all move it; the shaded band is how far off he expects to be.": "会在最后一次结算时留在金库里{0}工程完工、人家迁入迁出、风向变化和国王，都会让这一预测有所变动；阴影带是他预计的误差范围。",
